      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOO FAST (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fifth (23.05) at this track in a Maiden. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. Can make amends this time. BIG FINGERS (4) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing a neck behind Stringer in 22.75 and recording a new PB here. Strong latest and expected to measure up. REBORN RANDY (2) produced a moderate run last time when seventh at Richmond over 401m behind Here No Cash (23.94) in a Maiden. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. One of the better chances. IBROX SHINE (3) can run a bold race on best form.",
